# Beta gate — the codes (secret) and every use log and archive (personal
# data kept LOG_RETENTION_DAYS), must NEVER be baked into the image: in
# production beta/ is the live folder bind-mounted from the host (see
# docker-compose.prod.yml), and a file copied into an image layer would
# outlive the retention sweep and the backups. Only the example may enter.
beta/*
!beta/codes.example.json
